A||N||6||MontanaFiero||What spark plugs to use with my 3.4L?||||1||
Z||000000||MontanaFiero||09-09-2001||04:07 AM||||My 3.4 conversion is going well but slow. Now I need to determine which spark plugs I should use. <P>Obviously I don't have a 2.8--it's a 3.4 out of a '93 Camaro. But I am using the original '86 Fiero ignition system<P>I bought GM RapidFire plugs (25164639) for the Fiero 2.8.  (R42CTS)<BR>The Camaro motor had R43TSK plugs in it, similar to the Fiero 4 cyl.<P>How am I supposed to determine what I am <B>Supposed</B> to use, and what will give me the best performance?<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://members.home.net/blee291/fiero/mtfieroplate.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||ironhedno3||09-09-2001||11:49 PM||||use the plugs for the 3.4..it has a half point more compression which means a slightly colder plug||||reg||6
Z||000002||Alex4mula||09-10-2001||08:29 AM||||I'm currently using the same as in the 2.8 (R42TS). If I remember well I asked Ed Parks (he prepared my engine) and he told me to use the same. I wonder what difference will make using the Camaro plugs.<P>What is everybody else with 3.4s using?<p>[This message has been edited by Alex4mula (edited 09-10-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||MontanaFiero||09-10-2001||10:37 AM||||I just called ACE in Durango, CO--- I was told that the plugs need to match the engine (size, style and heat range), while the gap needs to match the ignition system. Basically, he said to use the plugs for the 3.4, then gap them to Fiero 2.8 specs.<P>I just called NAPA to do a plug cross-reference and guess what... The Rapidfire plugs are quite universal because the Rapidfire model #1 is a direct replacement for both motors. Guess I can't go wrong here.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://members.home.net/blee291/fiero/mtfieroplate.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by MontanaFiero (edited 09-10-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||Alex4mula||09-10-2001||04:07 PM||||What is everybody else with 3.4s using??||||reg||1
Z||000005||88formula||09-10-2001||04:14 PM||||I have the 2.8 spec plugs in my 3.4. <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000006||ferrari_momo||09-10-2001||10:33 PM||||are your 3.4 car(s) vibrates/ shakes?  mine does. i will post an ad about this agian in the forum.<BR>thanks,<BR>pat  <A HREF="http://www.thefibersmith.com" TARGET=_blank>www.thefibersmith.com</A> <P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
